{"page":324,"width":1764,"height":2610,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"Part 4","words":[{"text":"Part","x":582,"y":500,"width":130,"height":49},{"text":"4","x":735,"y":499,"width":37,"height":47}]},{"text":"17″夕尸※〃矛形결″亐扇","words":[{"text":"17″夕尸※〃矛形결″亐扇","x":186,"y":767,"width":742,"height":97}]},{"text":"컴퓨터의 가장 일차적인 임무는 프로그램을 수행시기는 일이다. 이 프로그램들은, 그것이 접근","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터의","x":300,"y":976,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"가장","x":440,"y":977,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"일차적인","x":515,"y":976,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"임무는","x":648,"y":976,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램을","x":747,"y":974,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"수행시기는","x":904,"y":973,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"일이다.","x":1060,"y":973,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":1166,"y":973,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램들은,","x":1204,"y":973,"width":188,"height":34},{"text":"그것이","x":1406,"y":973,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"접근","x":1514,"y":973,"width":63,"height":33}]},{"text":"6는 데이터와 함께, 실행하는 동안 일부분이라도 메인 메모리에 올라와 있어야 한다.","words":[{"text":"6는","x":297,"y":1031,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"데이터와","x":375,"y":1031,"width":126,"height":33},{"text":"함께,","x":513,"y":1032,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"실행하는","x":594,"y":1032,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"동안","x":725,"y":1031,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"일부분이라도","x":797,"y":1030,"width":173,"height":34},{"text":"메인","x":982,"y":1030,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"메모리에","x":1050,"y":1030,"width":112,"height":34},{"text":"올라와","x":1173,"y":1030,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"있어야","x":1273,"y":1030,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":1374,"y":1030,"width":69,"height":33}]},{"text":"최신 컴퓨터 시스템은 시스템 실행 중에 여러 프로세스를 메모리에 유지한다. 다양한 접근","words":[{"text":"최신","x":361,"y":1087,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":438,"y":1087,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"시스템은","x":544,"y":1087,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"시스템","x":676,"y":1088,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"실행","x":777,"y":1087,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"중에","x":845,"y":1087,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":916,"y":1086,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스를","x":983,"y":1087,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"메모리에","x":1139,"y":1087,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"유지한다.","x":1264,"y":1087,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"다양한","x":1409,"y":1085,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"접근","x":1514,"y":1085,"width":64,"height":33}]},{"text":"방식을 반영하는 많은 메모리 관리 기법이 있으며 각 알고리즘의 효고는 상황에 따라 다르다.","words":[{"text":"방식을","x":296,"y":1141,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"반영하는","x":407,"y":1142,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":548,"y":1144,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"메모리","x":622,"y":1144,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"관리","x":724,"y":1143,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"기법이","x":797,"y":1143,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"있으며","x":897,"y":1143,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"각","x":996,"y":1143,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":1037,"y":1144,"width":142,"height":33},{"text":"효고는","x":1192,"y":1144,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"상황에","x":1293,"y":1144,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"따라","x":1399,"y":1142,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"다르다.","x":1475,"y":1142,"width":101,"height":34}]},{"text":"시스템을 위한 메모리 관리 기법의 선택은 많은 요소, 특히 시스템의 하드웨어 설계에 따라 달","words":[{"text":"시스템을","x":296,"y":1197,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"위한","x":438,"y":1199,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"메모리","x":516,"y":1200,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"관리","x":618,"y":1200,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"기법의","x":692,"y":1200,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"선택은","x":792,"y":1199,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"많은","x":891,"y":1199,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"요소,","x":959,"y":1201,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"특히","x":1038,"y":1200,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"시스템의","x":1107,"y":1200,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1233,"y":1200,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"설계에","x":1365,"y":1200,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"따라","x":1472,"y":1200,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"달","x":1548,"y":1201,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"라진다. 거의 모든 알고리즘은 일정 형태의 하드웨어 지원이 필요하다.","words":[{"text":"라진다.","x":298,"y":1254,"width":102,"height":34},{"text":"거의","x":417,"y":1256,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":490,"y":1258,"width":64,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":565,"y":1256,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"일정","x":728,"y":1256,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"형태의","x":798,"y":1256,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"하드웨어","x":896,"y":1256,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"지원이","x":1022,"y":1256,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"필요하다.","x":1120,"y":1257,"width":121,"height":34}]}]}